\tag{fdip}
\title{Signature from a reflection}
\date{2026-11-12}

\p{The derived form of \ref{fdip-00PB} is positive when the weights
are positive. Reversing a direction does not change those
weights. Which involutions of the calculus are reflection
positive, and which signature does such an involution give the
twisted form?}

